window.products.push({"id":463216,"name":"Eukein Electric Pepper Grinder, Electric Salt Grinder, Battery Powered Automatic Salt Or Pepper Mill Shaker With A Light, One Hand Grips Thumb Operati","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7143c7+wOyL._AC_SL1454_.jpg","description":"Do you want a portable gadget that helps you grind salt and pepper quickly and precisely to bring out their zesty flavor? If so, the Eukein Automatic Electric Pepper and Salt Grinder Mill is the perfect kitchen tool for you! Our electric pepper and salt grinder mills are designed and manufactured for convenience, precision grind and durable performance. - It features close to diamond hardness ceramic mechanism , providing longer life performance than metal blades. - The ceramic blades are rust-proof, non-corrosive non-reactive , that will not alter the flavor of the salt and pepper ground. - It has a transparent see-through chamber , for easy monitoring of contents to determines when to refill. - A Cap at bottom that prevents leakages while also help keeping salt and pepper dry in humid environment. - It can easily adjust the coarseness of your salt and pepper from fine or coarse by turning a knob at the bottom, with no pre-set precision level limitation, closer the blades finer the grounds, any precision you preferred. - Cordless battery operated , can easily move around in the kitchen while cooking. You can also carry it to dinning table, living room, or even to picnic and BBQ party. - One-button single-hand operation . This grinder is so easy to use with just a single hand, it is designed for quick cooking, for busy moms, for elders or even for kids to use at ease. Just a push the button and enjoy the flash, pure flavor anytime you wish. - A light bulb located at the bottom of mill will light up while operating and help you to spray amount of salt and pepper on meal you desire. - All wrapped in a tasteful stainless steel casing that gives it decorative flair in your kitchen, your home. - Ideal for people with Arthritis","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7143c7+wOyL._AC_SL1454_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eukein","source_asin":"B0C345N72K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-463216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C345N72K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C345N72K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
