window.products.push({"id":463329,"name":"Soap Dish with Slanted Waterfall Design by HTB, Bar Soap Holder Teak Wood, Soap Saver for Shower, Bathroom, Kitchen, Sinks and Countertop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gyqF56ThS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Teak Wood AUTOMATIC DRAINAGE SOAP DISH- Are you still bothered by the mushy soap sitting in water? Here’s a solution! Our teak soap dish has a slanted drainage design to drain water quickly, and the comb-shaped overhead structure keeps a ventilated and dry environment for the soap to prevent your soap from becoming mushy and extend soap life. SOAP STOPS SLIPPING OFF- The non-slip curved concave design of our brown soap dish allows your soap can’t slip out from the soap holder when placing it after use. ONE-PIECE DESIGN: Our natural soap savers are made of one solid piece of natural teak wood without glue, nails or slats. Teak is often used for boat building and exterior construction. Multifunctional and Minimalist Style- Just a bar soap holder? Oh no, why not use it in the kitchen for placing your sponge or dish cleaning balls. Our rectangular soap dish can be used not only in the bathroom but also in the bathtub, kitchen, washstand, countertop, shower, sink, basin, etc. CONTEMPORARY DESIGN MAKES A GREAT GIFT IDEA- Whether you're buying our draining soap dish for yourself or as a gift for family or friends, its unique and elegant style means it will look good wherever you put it, regardless of the decor, fixtures, or accessories you may have. And this natural soap holder is perfectly sized at 4.8*3.1*0.6 Inches. so it won't take up much space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gyqF56ThS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HTB","source_asin":"B09F8HT9C6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-463329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F8HT9C6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F8HT9C6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
