window.products.push({"id":463331,"name":"Nightstand with Charging Station and USB Ports,Oak Grey Night Stand 3 Cube Storage Shelf,Mid-Century Modern Bedside Table with Drawers,Small End Bed S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I5Ck+kSeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Make Energy Within Reach】This rustic oak grey nightstand with charging stand is equipped with two standard outlets and two USB ports which can easily charge your phone, tablet, and even your laptop. The 6.56 ft long power supply cord allows you to move this modern night stand freely,and the portable design makes life more comfortable! Also, the proper distance between plugs ensures no space fighting for an outlet. Low battery? No worries! No need to look around! It’s within your arm’s reach! 【Mid-Century Modern Bedside Tables】This bedside table uses a rustic oak grey natural wood grain design with solid wood decorative legs. It retains the retro wood texture, but without losing the modern pop style. An organic aesthetic, delicate linear detail, and novel Partition storage design bring iconic style to this mid-century bed side table.Its essence lies in the perfect combination of exquisite retro tones and new design concepts, highlighting the style and texture of furniture matching! 【Reliable Materials Create Stable Structure】The strong wooden nightstand is made of EPA certificated P2 particle board and solid wood legs reinforced by special screws to ensure durability and stability. Thickened tabletop and reinforced table legs not only ensures large weight capacity(65 lb), but also creates a clean-cut silhouette for a touch of visual intrigue. The high-quality materials used in the small end side table with charging stand escort your safe and healthy life. 【Small Footprint But Large Storage Space】The 3 cube modern nightstands with drawer adopts a simple vertical design, which reduces the complexity and saves space to a great extent. Its size is 16.35 '' L x 13.4 '' W x 27.01'' H . Show your beloved photos and an alarm clock to remind you on the desktop of this suitable sized bedside table. The simple but practical drawers allows you to easily organize your daily necessities and make your life elegant and exquisite. 【Easier Installation & Most Intimate Details】In order to make your installation more convenient, the multifunction bedside tables for bedroom comes with step-by-step instructions and all marked tool parts. You can put them together as easily as playing a game of blocks. We design the package particularly with thicker foam, firm edges as well as two-tier packaging to protect the night stand with electric outlet in good condition upon arriving.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I5Ck+kSeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joaxswe","source_asin":"B09TKYV9Z9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-463331","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TKYV9Z9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TKYV9Z9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
