window.products.push({"id":463390,"name":"Adubor Mulberry Silk Pillowcase for Hair and Skin with Hidden Zipper, Both Side 23 Momme Silk,900 Thread Count (20x30inch, Queen Size, White, 1pc)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lBT5Y+zaL._AC_SL1371_.jpg","description":"23 Momme Silk Pillowcase Quality Silk Material: Adubor silk pillowcases are all made of high quality mulberry silk, which is ultra soft and breathable.Sleeping on silk will bring lot of health benefits for people. You will be younger and more beautiful with silk. Best for Hair and Skin: Mulberry silk is is composed of animal protein and contains 18 kinds of essential amino acid, which can nourish the skin, increase the skin epidermis vigor and prevent skin aging.In addition,Mulberry silk could keep your hair moisturized and healthy, preserve your style while you sleep, and keep hair free of pesky tangle. Comfortable and Temperature regulation: Silk is the most Comfortable of all fabrics because of its natural protein structure. In addition, sleeping on a mulberry silk pillowcase, helps you to feel cool during summer nights because mulberry silk bedding is surprisingly breathable and efficiently wicks your sweat away when you become too hot. Hidden Zipper and Silk Care: Adubor Quality silk pillowcase is equiped with invisible zipper design, which could hold your pillowcase perfectly.Dry clean or hand wash are preferred and recommended. You can machine wash by following these steps: turn inside out or use a mesh wash bag, wash in cold water on the hand-wash or delicate cycle. Use mild detergent. WHAT YOU CAN GET: Adubor Mulberry Silk Pillowcase 1 pc with elegant gift package box; We believe that you will love this silk Pillowcase as much as we do. Your satisfaction is our top priority.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lBT5Y+zaL._AC_SL1371_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adubor","source_asin":"B07XD9468J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-463390","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XD9468J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XD9468J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":463391,"name":"Braun WK200W Aqua Express Electric Water Kettle, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41tY1Hk0SdL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Large 54 Ounce Capacity / Heats water with AC power / Carry Jug to table Water level indicator on both sides Easy filling through large spout Lime scale filter for fresh taste Cool-to-touch lid Color - White Amazon.com Featuring an ergonomic handle and smooth lines, Braun's 1,500-watt electric water kettle handily sits on a separate heating element. When water boils--one cup takes only 70 seconds--it's a relief to pick up the kettle and pour without worrying about the plug dragging behind. Once the kettle is removed from the base, it automatically turns off for safety. This good-sized kettle heats up to six cups of water, making it ideal for small meetings at the office or to quickly heat up water (and water only, please) at home. It has an anti-calcification filter to help keep the water tasting clear and clean. --Dana Van Nest","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41tY1Hk0SdL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Braun","source_asin":"B000EVNZDE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-463391","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EVNZDE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EVNZDE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":463392,"name":"Essos Square Glass Jars with Wood Lids Set of (2) 80 fl oz Airtight and Stackable Storage Containers for Kitchen Pantry or Bathroom BPA Free and Recyc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CgLSYi1SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔎 - ORGANIZE YOUR PANTRY - These jars are perfect for storing cookies, coffee, pasta, beans and other dry goods. The airtight seal keeps your food fresh and tasty. Keep out moisture, smells and bugs! Keep in great tasting food. 🌷 - STORE YOUR FOOD IN STYLE - These sleek and stylish glass jars are perfect for the modern kitchen. The lids are made of real acacia wood and NOT bamboo. Get rid of ugly plastic, cardboard, bags and make your food the center of attention. Looks great in the pantry or on the counter. ♻️ - ECO-FRIENDLY – Made with eco-friendly materials, these jars are a great choice for those who care about the environment. Replace plastic containers with a permanent, reusable and 100% recyclable storage solution. The jars are made of recyclable glass and silicone seal, the lids are made of real wood. The jars are food safe and the seal is BPA free. 💪 - QUALITY CONTAINERS - These sturdy glass jars are made to last. Thicker and more durable glass than other containers. The airtight seal keeps food fresh and the stackable design saves space. The glass is dishwasher safe and the lids are hand wash only. 🎁 - FREE CHALK PEN AND LABEL - Get organized and stylish right away. Chalk labels are reusable, just wet wipe and relabel. The jars come in a well packaged box and would be great as a birthday, house warming, mother's day or Christmas gift! ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ - CUSTOMER SATISFACTION is our top priority. We want you to have a quality product when shopping with us. If you have any issues with our product, please contact us and we will work to resolve them as quickly as possible. Thank you for supporting a U.S. based small business.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CgLSYi1SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Essos","source_asin":"B098M4W2G4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-463392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098M4W2G4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098M4W2G4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
