window.products.push({"id":463398,"name":"Royal RY7300 Protégé Upright Vacuum Cleaner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3157A5S1K2L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description A 14-inch wide cleaning path, the power of a 12-amp bypass motor, and an automatic height adjustment ensure this vaccum fits you and your cleaning needs. Royal's history of making commercial models gives you the benefit of a substantial 15-inch nozzle and a metal brush roll and base plate. A HEPA-type filtration system and tools and attachments like the crevice, upholstery tool, dust brush, and telescopic wand make it easy to thoroughly clean even the hard to reach areas. Amazon.com Powered by a 12-amp motor, the Royal Protégé provides plenty of muscle for removing even ground-in dirt from carpets or floors. The 15-inch-wide nozzle covers a greater area, shortening tedious cleaning time, while HEPA-type filtration captures 99.9% of dust and allergens, making this model a great choice for asthma sufferers. The RapidReach hose extends the users grasp and eases access to awkward spots such as underneath furniture or beds, while a complete suite of onboard tools further extends the Protégés cleaning abilities, including a crevice tool, upholstery tool, dust brush, and telescopic wand to clean ceilings, baseboards, couches, and more. The 35-foot power cord lets users clean even large single rooms without having to unplug and replug, and the rubber wheels wont mark hardwood floors. The vacuums solid construction features a metal brushroll and metal plate for improved durability, and the bypass motor system means even large pieces of debris wont burn out the motor or fan. Additional features include a full bag indicator, a brilliant headlight for illuminating dark corners and crevices, automatic height adjustment, and a sturdy metal handle with comfort grip. The Royal Protégé RY7300 weighs 24 pounds for shipping and is covered by a four-year warranty. From the Manufacturer The Royal RY7300 Protégé was designed with power enhancing features from the nozzle up. A 15-inch nozzle allows for an enhanced cleaning path which gets the job done fast. A powerful 12-amp motor makes cleaning ground-in dirt easy. Plus, the metal brushroll and base plate provide for increased durability. The vacuum also features a by-pass motor system that eliminates damage from large debris, HEPA-type filtration system, automatic height adjustment, comfort grip with metal handle, anti-marring rubber wheels, full bag indicator, brilliant headlight, and 35-foot power cord. Royal offers a 4-year warranty. What's in the Box: RY7300, RapidReach hose and on-board tools: Crevice tool, upholstery tool, dust brush and telescopic wand, instruction manual, warranty card. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3157A5S1K2L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal","source_asin":"B0009QWA08","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-463398","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0009QWA08","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0009QWA08","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
