window.products.push({"id":463501,"name":"AK-Trading Giant Real Touch Artificial Foam Paper Craft Rose DIY 3D Artificial Flowers for Wedding Room Wall Decoration - Pack of 2-24\" Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MyISyoOQL._AC_.jpg","description":"From simple and contemporary, to rustic and fanciful, flowers play an integral part in any celebration. Whether to express your love and friendship or to congratulate your loved ones, fabulous flowers say it all! Adding radiance and romance into your festive moments, these beauties not only decorate your celebrations in a vibrant manner, but also impart a refreshing and lively feel to it. Seal your merry moments with our Bigger, Brighter, and most Beautiful Giant Size Foam Flowers, that won’t wither or wilt, unlike their fresh counterparts, thus continue oozing joy and color for as long as you want. These large foam flowers are intricately handcrafted by artisans to achieve the appearance of natural flowers. Made from sumptuous foam, our NEW giant foam artificial flowers are realistically shaped and wonderful to the touch. Transform your dull and lackluster home space or party ambiance into a divine paradise of magical flowers by draping your event from floor to ceiling with these life-like foam flowers. Gorgeously hand rolled petals have such realistic finishing details that they will surely leave your guests and invitees wonderstruck at their bigger and bolder beauty. Let your imaginations and creativity run wild, design and decorate like a professional florist with these brilliant blossoms. Create a lovely flower backdrop elevating your gathering to the ultimate grandeur, make a floriated photo backdrop with multi-sized and multi-colored foam flowers, make an impressive statement with a single giant flower being held by the bride, bridesmaids, or maid of honor, use as a fun and affordable alternative to fresh flower arrangement centerpieces, create a jaw dropping entrance or passage by accenting your staircase or wedding aisle with dozens of blooming foam flowers, make an exquisite table runner with these 3-D flowers , forget chair covers when you have a huge 3 dimensional flower chair accent, so pretty!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MyISyoOQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AK TRADING CO.","source_asin":"B078X22WD9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-463501","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078X22WD9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078X22WD9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
