window.products.push({"id":463604,"name":"BarnwoodUSA Black Rustic Shelves, Square Floating Wood Shadowbox, Home Decor, Set of 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XH39CifAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SET OF 3: With your purchase, you′ll receive a pack of 3 shelves that come in a shadowbox style. These shelves are our square option. They feature an open back, giving these shelves a fun farmhouse feel. Use them to display your favorite trinkets and curios. You could also place small books or plants inside. WOODEN SHELVING FOR ANY ROOM: This decorative shelf unit will add country home decor to any room in your house. Set it up in your bedroom, bathroom, living room, office, or kitchen for a rustic appeal. It is truly a beautiful accent piece that will easily transform the atmosphere and ambiance of your home. GENUINE RECYCLED WOOD: Unlike other wood claiming to be upcycled, these wooden shelf boxes are made of genuine wood and are 100⁒ repurposed. Other companies may claim the wood they provide is recycled, but you can trust with BarnwoodUSA products, all of the wood is reused. We love upcycled wood because it isn’t harsh on the environment and reduces waste. DIMENSIONS: You'll get 3 shelves of varying sizes when you order these square shelves. The first shelf measures at 8\" x 8\", while the second one is 10\" x 10\". Finally, the third shelf measures at 12\" x 12\". Each shelf is 3\" deep. You'll also receive hangers to help you install your new shelves. ABOUT US: Here at BarnwoodUSA, we began working with national retailers to build a quality brand right here in the USA. This led our team to start the BarnwoodUSA line of frames, which grew to include a wide variety of home decor that is created with upcycled wood by our employees in Oklahoma City. Our mission is to take something old and forgotten and turn it into something beautiful.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XH39CifAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BarnwoodUSA","source_asin":"B07QDPN3GP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-463604","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QDPN3GP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QDPN3GP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":463605,"name":"Abestorm 270 PPD Commercial Dehumidifier with Pump, Large Industrial Dehumidifier with Drain Hose for Basements, Garages, Flood Restoration, with Auto","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1467.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KvyXh96nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"POWERFUL DEHUMIDIFICATION ABILITY- Removal of 270 pints at saturation condition and 125 pints at AHAM, up to 3,000 sq. ft dehumidification area. Removing extra moisture from rooms in residential settings and commercial premises, this dehumidifier is made to suck up high amounts of humid air from enclosed spaces. COMMERCIAL DEHUMIDIFIER WITH PUMP- Equipped with a powerful pump, this commercial dehumidifier can pump the collected water out to a distance of over 20 ft. Ideal for removing dampness and moisture from water damage restoration, carpet cleaning, basements/cellars, laundries, de-flooding, drying furnishing, offices, laboratories, tradesmen, and garages. EASY TO OPERATE CONTROL PANEL- No complicated function button, this powerful dehumidifier adopts simple user control including a large clear LCD panel, auto-humidistat, memory starting, auto defrosting, you can get any job site done with just a few buttons. Temperature/Humidity display at both inlet and outlet sides, ideal for water damage restoration projects. HUMANIZED DESIGN, DURABLE DEHUMIDIFIER- Built in a compact, rugged and lightweight design, this water damage restoration dehumidifier is designed with a rigid handle and rubber wheels to facilitate transport. Onboard storage for 20' power cord and 20' condensate hose. Comes with unique Rare Earth Alloy Tube Evaporator technology, greatly extending product life. SAFETY TESTED DEHUMIDIFIER, ETL LISTED- This safety-tested dehumidifier is fully compliant with the electrical safety ETL. Every Abestorm dehumidifier comes with a 5-year warranty, and a professional customer support team ready to assist at any time. Please feel free to contact us if you meet an issue with your dehumidifier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KvyXh96nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Abestorm","source_asin":"B09N97DZBD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-463605","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N97DZBD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N97DZBD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
