window.products.push({"id":463676,"name":"SUPER DEAL 1500W Electric Air Fryer 4.4 Quart W/Timer, Temperature Control, Detachable Basket Handles Free Oil (Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jnf8rSl+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Warm Note: 1. When the machine works, the temperature is really high, there is a high temperature warning label on the machine. 2. When halfway opened it, the machine will not automatically shut down. 3. When you take it out, you'd better wear protective gloves such as high temperature gloves.  Any questions pls contact seller for help. Package Contents: 1 x 1500W Electric Air Fryer 1 x Tong *Bonus* 1x Steaming Rack*Bonus* 1x Separator *Bonus* 1 x Manual SPECIFICATIONS: Dimensions: 13”(L) x 10”(W) x 13“(H); Weight: 11.05 lbs.; Mesh Basket Demension: 7.5\" x 7.5\" x 3.5\"; Fryer Pan Demension: 8\" x 8\" x 4.6\"; Mesh Basket Capacity: 2.8 Quart (2.7L); Fryer Pan Capacity: 4.4 Quart (4.2L); Material: Plastic, Specialty; Volts: 110-120V, 60Hz; Timer: 0-30min; Temperature Range: 176 to 392 degree; Power Indicator: Yes; Heating Indicator: Yes; Detachable Basket: Yes; Color: Black/White/Red; No assembly required How Does It Work? Air fryer technology is similar to a convection oven but upgraded. The Air Fryer has a revolutionary fan technology that virtually eliminates unnecessary fats and oils that usually plague the fried foods that we all love During the cooking process, the oil drips into a basket below. The food then Air Fries by lifting the excess oil and coating the food while it is airborne. This results in delicious foods that have a fried texture while eliminating the uses of oil and fat The Rapid Air Circulation Technology ensures that your food is cooked throughout, evenly, and all sides by distributing the heat thoroughly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jnf8rSl+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPER DEAL","source_asin":"B0719RXXDN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-463676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0719RXXDN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0719RXXDN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
