window.products.push({"id":463776,"name":"Knife Storage Organizer and Holder - Kitchen Knives Block Organizer with Over the Door Mounted Keeps Your Knife Collection in One Place 1010 (1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OlRJb+slL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Store your sharp knives safely with this knife storage organizer and holder Save Space in Your Cutlery Drawer and Countertop This knife tray sticks on the wall while it provides quick and easy access to different knife types in a flash. With 13 slots, our knife organizer maintains your knife collection in vertical position, leaving the handle on air and the sharp blade stored, thus keeping fingers safe from sharp edges. Suitable for Different Knives Our knife tray can fit knives of different blade lengths. Whether you have a complete kitchen knife collection or bought individual types to meet your cooking needs, our knife holder and organizer keeps them safely and securely in place. Sturdy and Durable Crafted with durable ABS plastic, our knife storage organizer and holder is built to support weight and length of your knives perfectly. It’s simple and plain to complement your modern kitchen. Click add to cart button and order your knife organizer today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OlRJb+slL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YBM HOME","source_asin":"B07RL3XZRZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-463776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RL3XZRZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RL3XZRZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":463777,"name":"New Automatic Gourmet Stainless Steel Electric Salt Pepper Mill Grinder(Stainless) by Generic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ASAK5AQkL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description : Perfect for kitchen use or tabletop display, this stylish mill/grinder features a brushed stainless steel body, a transparent viewing area and a high quality ceramic grinder. The hardened, spring-loaded mechanism provides a consistent grinding, cracking salt or peppercorn down evenly. The acrylic viewing area enables you to easily know when to refill the compartment with pepper or salt. It also features a bottom light that allows you to spread the correct amount of seasoning right above the food. With an easy push of the top button, the grinding job is done! Specifications: Color:Silver Body: Brushed Stainless Steel  Spice Chamber: Acrylic Grinder: Ceramic Weight: 0.31kg/0.69lbs (without batteries) Diameter: 5.5cm/2.17in ☆ Height: 23.5cm/9.25in  Voltage: DC 6V Package includes: 1 grinder Notice:  Do not use new and used batteries together. Do not leave the batteries in the motor unit during extended periods of non-use. The batteries may leak and damage the mill. Shake the mill if the seasoning is clogged. If the seasoning becomes damp or the mill becomes clogged, empty the grinder and wipe clean with a dry cloth. If the grinder is still clogged, rinse it in warm water. Before filling and reassembling, make sure the grinder is dry enough. Cleaning Instructions: Clean the body of the mill with a damp cloth. Never immerse the mill in water or put it in the dishwasher. Take it apart and wash the pepper holder separately. Clean the inside with a small brush and dish detergent. Rinse thoroughly and let it dry before use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ASAK5AQkL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B00X7WXY42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-463777","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00X7WXY42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00X7WXY42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
